---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Privacy Policy — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Privacy policy: no cookies, no tracking of your tool inputs, anonymous aggregate statistics only." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="privacy-main">
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="updated">Last updated: September 1, 2026</p>

			<h2>Your tool inputs stay local</h2>
			<p>
				Every tool on this site — calculators, converters, generators, the QR code maker —
				runs entirely in your browser. The values you type are processed by JavaScript on
				your device and are <strong>never transmitted, stored or logged</strong> by this
				site. You can verify this yourself: open your browser's network inspector while
				using any tool.
			</p>

			<h2>Analytics</h2>
			<p>
				This site uses <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong>, which runs without cookies
				and without collecting personal information. It reports only aggregate, anonymous
				page-visit counts — no fingerprints, no cross-site tracking, no individual visitor
				profiles.
			</p>

			<h2>Advertising (future)</h2>
			<p>
				The site plans to display ads served by Google AdSense. If and when ads appear,
				Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to
				this or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising via
				<a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>,
				and more options are described in
				<a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's advertising policies</a>.
			</p>

			<h2>Your rights (GDPR / CCPA)</h2>
			<p>
				Because the analytics used here is cookie-free and anonymous, this site does not
				hold personal data about you, so there is nothing to access, export or delete. If
				personalized advertising cookies are introduced with ads, residents of the EEA, UK
				and Switzerland will see a consent choice before any such cookie is set, and
				California residents may opt out of the "sale" of personal information via the
				same mechanism.
			</p>

			<h2>Hosting</h2>
			<p>
				The site is statically hosted on GitHub Pages. The hosting provider records
				standard request logs (IP address, user agent, timestamp) for security and abuse
				protection, as described in
				<a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.
			</p>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				Questions about this policy can be raised on
				<a href="https://github.com/qcsunny/qcsunny.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
			</p>

			<section lang="zh-CN">
				<h2>隐私政策（中文）</h2>
				<p>
					本站所有工具（计算器、换算器、生成器、二维码）均在浏览器本地运行。你输入的内容只在本机由
					JavaScript 处理，<strong>绝不会上传、存储或记录</strong>。你可以在使用任意工具时打开浏览器的网络面板自行验证。
				</p>
				<p>
					本站统计使用 Cloudflare Web Analytics：无 cookie、不收集个人信息，只提供匿名的汇总访问计数。
				</p>
				<p>
					本站计划展示 Google AdSense 广告。广告上线后，Google 及其合作伙伴可能使用 cookie 依据你此前访问本站或其他网站的情况投放广告，
					你可以在 Google 广告设置中选择停用个性化广告。站点静态托管于 GitHub Pages，托管方会按其隐私声明记录标准请求日志用于安全防护。
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.privacy-main {
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}
	h1 {
		color: var(--fg);
		font-size: 1.8rem;
	}
	h2 {
		color: var(--fg);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-top: 2em;
	}
	a {
		color: var(--accent);
	}
	section[lang="zh-CN"] {
		line-height: 1.9;
	}
	.updated {
		color: var(--dim);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
</style>
